        "language": "english",
        "review": "Cards on the table: This game isn't for me.\r\n\r\nNo way in hell I'm giving it a No though. It's one of the strangest games I've seen, and that's saying a fair bit. It's a strangely deep horse racing sim... with lava flows, ghost storms, and gravel grounds. It has dinosaurs to mix with confused horses to create abominations... to race them. It's also got such screen options as \"Ham Radio but visual\" \"Ham Radio that is almost dead\" and \"Oh this is just deep fried now.\" \r\n\r\nBut it's also, 100% obviously: A labor of love that someone just had to get out in the world, and we're better for it. It's something unique and neat. Just because it's not what I go for doesn't mean I don't want a horse in the race.",
